#: ../../tokens.md:1
msgid "Tokens and languages"
msgstr "Àwọn token àti àwọn èdè"

#: ../../tokens.md:3
msgid ""
"Models do not read words. They read tokens, which are pieces of text. You"
" pay for tokens, your `max_tokens` limit is measured in tokens, and "
"longer token counts take longer to process. So it helps to know how many "
"tokens your text will use before you send it."
msgstr ""
"Àwọn model kì í ka àwọn ọ̀rọ̀. Wọ́n ń ka àwọn token, tí ó jẹ́ àwọn àjákù "
"ọ̀rọ̀. O ń san owó fún àwọn token, ààlà `max_tokens` rẹ̀ sì jẹ́ nípa iye "
"token, àti pé iye token tó pọ̀ máa ń gba àkókò púpọ̀ sí i láti ṣe processing. "
"Nítorí náà, ó dára láti mọ iye token tí text rẹ yóò lò kí o tó fi ránṣẹ́."

#: ../../tokens.md:5
msgid "Why the same idea can cost different amounts"
msgstr "Ìdí tí èrò kan náà fi lè ná iye tó yàtọ̀"

#: ../../tokens.md:7
msgid ""
"A tokenizer that was built mostly around English text often cuts words "
"from other languages into more pieces. The same sentence in two languages"
" can therefore use a different number of tokens, even when the meaning is"
" identical. If you build for several languages, check token counts for "
"each one instead of assuming they match."
msgstr ""
"Tokenizer tí a ṣe ní pàtàkì fún text Gẹ̀ẹ́sì sábà máa ń pín àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ láti "
"àwọn èdè míì sí àwọn àjákù púpọ̀ sí i. Nítorí náà, gbolóhùn kan náà ní àwọn "
"èdè méjì lè lo iye token tó yàtọ̀, bó tilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé ìtumọ̀ wọn jẹ́ ọ̀kan náà. "
"Tí o bá ń kọ́ fún ọ̀pọ̀ èdè, ṣàyẹ̀wò iye token fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan dípò kí o "
"rò pé gbogbo wọn jẹ́ iye kan náà."

#: ../../tokens.md:9
msgid "Count tokens before you send"
msgstr "Ka àwọn token kí o tó fi ránṣẹ́"

#: ../../tokens.md:11
msgid "`POST /v1/tokens/count` returns the token count for a piece of text."
msgstr "`POST /v1/tokens/count` máa ń dá iye token fún àjákù text padà."

#: ../../tokens.md:14
msgid ""
"Lugha uses a deliberately simple tokenizer. It cuts every word into "
"pieces of at most four characters. That makes results easy to explain and"
" reproduce. It does not describe how any real model counts tokens, so "
"treat the numbers below as a demonstration of the endpoint, not a "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"Lugha ń lo tokenizer tó rọrùn ní ìmọ̀ọ́mọ̀. Ó ń pín ọ̀rọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan sí àwọn "
"àjákù tí kò ju lẹ́tà mẹ́rin lọ. Èyí ń jẹ́ kí ó rọrùn láti ṣàlàyé àti láti "
"tun àwọn results ṣe. Kì í ṣe àpèjúwe bí model gidi ṣe ń ka token, nítorí "
"náà, wo àwọn nọ́ńbà tó wà nísàlẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àfihàn endpoint, kì í ṣe "
"measurement."

#: ../../tokens.md:17
msgid "Count an English sentence:"
msgstr "Ka àwọn token nínú gbolóhùn Gẹ̀ẹ́sì kan:"

#: ../../tokens.md:30
msgid "Now a Swahili sentence:"
msgstr "Ní báyìí, gbolóhùn Swahili kan:"

#: ../../tokens.md:43
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../tokens.md:44
msgid "The number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Iye token tó wà nínú text náà."

#: ../../tokens.md:46
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../tokens.md:47
msgid "The number of words, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Iye ọ̀rọ̀, tí a pín sílẹ̀ níbi àwọn ààyè."

#: ../../tokens.md:49
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../tokens.md:50
msgid ""
"`token_count` divided by `word_count`, rounded to two decimals. Use it to"
" compare texts of different lengths."
msgstr ""
"`token_count` tí a pín pẹ̀lú `word_count`, tí a sì yí padà sí decimal méjì. "
"Lo ó láti fi text tó ní gígùn yàtọ̀ wé ara wọn."

#: ../../tokens.md:52
msgid "How tokens show up elsewhere"
msgstr "Bí àwọn token ṣe ń farahàn ní àwọn ibi mìíràn"

#: ../../tokens.md:54
msgid ""
"The `usage` object in a `/v1/generate` response reports the same counts "
"for a real request: `prompt_tokens` for what you sent and "
"`completion_tokens` for what came back."
msgstr ""
"Object `usage` nínú response `/v1/generate` ń fi iye kan náà hàn fún "
"request gidi: `prompt_tokens` fún ohun tí o rán àti `completion_tokens` "
"fún ohun tí ó padà wá."

#: ../../tokens.md:56
msgid ""
"`max_tokens` limits `completion_tokens` only. It does not include your "
"prompt. If the model reaches the limit, the response ends with "
"`finish_reason` set to `length`."
msgstr ""
"`max_tokens` ń fi ààlà sí `completion_tokens` nìkan. Kò kà prompt rẹ̀ sí. "
"Tí model bá dé ààlà náà, response máa parí pẹ̀lú `finish_reason` tí a ṣètò "
"sí `length`."

#: ../../tokens.md:58
msgid ""
"Count your prompt first if you want to estimate the size of a request "
"before you make it."
msgstr ""
"Ka àwọn token inú prompt rẹ̀ kọ́kọ́ tí o bá fẹ́ mọ iye tí request kan lè "
"jẹ́ kí o tó ṣe é."